{"kind":"html","caption":"从矩阵右上角开始搜索：当前位置大于 target 时整列都不可能匹配，向左移动；小于 target 时整行都不可能匹配，向下移动。动画依次演示 target = 5 时找到目标，以及 target = 20 时越界结束；每一步都排除一整行或一整列，时间复杂度为 O(m+n)，空间复杂度为 O(1)。","html":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>搜索二维矩阵 II</title>\n<style>\n*{box-sizing:border-box}html,body{margin:0;background:#1c1c1c;color:#d4d4d4;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.45}\nmain{max-width:560px;margin:0 auto;padding:8px 10px 10px}\nh1{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600}\n.lead{margin:0 0 8px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:12px}\n.layout{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;align-items:flex-start}\n.matrix{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(5,38px);gap:4px;flex:0 0 auto}\n.cell{width:38px;min-height:48px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:4px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;background:#2d2d2d;font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;transition:.32s}\n.cell.active{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;color:#fff}\n.cell.removed{opacity:.2;transform:scale(.95)}\n.cell.found{background:#0e639c;border-color:#3794ff;box-shadow:0 0 0 1px #3794ff}\n.info{flex:1 1 180px;padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid #3c3c3c;border-radius:6px;background:#252526;min-width:0}\n.target{font-size:12px;margin-bottom:8px}\n.num{font-family:\"SF Mono\",Monaco,Menlo,monospace;color:#3794ff}\n.rule{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin:8px 0}\n.rule div{padding:4px 8px;background:#2d2d2d;border-left:3px solid #555;border-radius:4px;font-size:10px;line-height:1.4}\n.rule .on{border-color:#3794ff;background:#0e639c;color:#fff}\n.status{line-height:1.45;min-height:48px;font-size:11px}\n.result{font-size:12px;color:#3794ff;font-weight:600;margin-top:6px}\n.progress{margin-top:8px;height:3px;background:#3c3c3c;border-radius:2px;overflow:hidden}\n.bar{height:100%;background:#3794ff;width:0}\n.hint{margin-top:6px;color:#8d8d8d;font-size:10px}\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main>\n<h1>右上角搜索</h1>\n<p class=\"lead\">每步排除整行或整列；自动切换两个 target。</p>\n<section class=\"layout\">\n<div id=\"matrix\" class=\"matrix\" aria-label=\"示例矩阵\"></div>\n<aside class=\"info\">\n<div class=\"target\">目标：<span id=\"target\" class=\"num\"></span></div>\n<div class=\"rule\">\n<div id=\"left\">值 &gt; 目标：向左，排除列</div>\n<div id=\"down\">值 &lt; 目标：向下，排除行</div>\n<div id=\"hit\">值 = 目标：成功</div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"status\" class=\"status\"></div>\n<div id=\"result\" class=\"result\"></div>\n<div class=\"progress\"><div id=\"bar\" class=\"bar\"></div></div>\n<div class=\"hint\">起点：右上角 (0,4)</div>\n</aside>\n</section>\n</main>\n<script>\nconst data=[[1,4,7,11,15],[2,5,8,12,19],[3,6,9,16,22],[10,13,14,17,24],[18,21,23,26,30]];\nconst cases=[{target:5},{target:20}];\nconst box=document.getElementById('matrix');\ndata.flat().forEach((v,i)=>{const e=document.createElement('div');e.className='cell';e.textContent=v;e.dataset.r=Math.floor(i/5);e.dataset.c=i%5;box.appendChild(e)});\nconst cells=[...document.querySelectorAll('.cell')],targetEl=document.getElementById('target'),statusEl=document.getElementById('status'),resultEl=document.getElementById('result'),bar=document.getElementById('bar');\nconst rules={left:document.getElementById('left'),down:document.getElementById('down'),hit:document.getElementById('hit')};\nlet ci=0,r=0,c=4,removed=new Set(),timer;\nfunction key(a,b){return a+'-'+b}\nfunction reset(){clearTimeout(timer);r=0;c=4;removed=new Set();cells.forEach(x=>x.className='cell');Object.values(rules).forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('on'));targetEl.textContent=cases[ci].target;statusEl.innerHTML='从右上角 <span class=\"num\">(0, 4)</span> 开始。';resultEl.textContent='';bar.style.transition='none';bar.style.width='0';requestAnimationFrame(()=>{bar.style.transition='width 8s linear';bar.style.width='100%'});timer=setTimeout(step,900)}\nfunction paint(){cells.forEach(x=>{x.className='cell';if(removed.has(key(+x.dataset.r,+x.dataset.c)))x.classList.add('removed')});if(r<5&&c>=0)cells[r*5+c].classList.add('active')}\nfunction step(){Object.values(rules).forEach(x=>x.classList.remove('on'));if(r>=5||c<0){paint();statusEl.textContent='搜索位置越出矩阵，没有剩余候选区域。';resultEl.textContent='结果：false';timer=setTimeout(next,1800);return}paint();const v=data[r][c],t=cases[ci].target;statusEl.innerHTML='检查 <span class=\"num\">('+r+', '+c+')</span>，值 <span class=\"num\">'+v+'</span>。';if(v===t){rules.hit.classList.add('on');cells[r*5+c].classList.add('found');resultEl.textContent='结果：true';timer=setTimeout(next,1800);return}if(v>t){rules.left.classList.add('on');for(let i=0;i<5;i++)removed.add(key(i,c));c--}else{rules.down.classList.add('on');for(let j=0;j<5;j++)removed.add(key(r,j));r++}timer=setTimeout(step,1050)}\nfunction next(){ci=(ci+1)%cases.length;reset()}\nreset();\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>","svg":"","media":""}
